00:39:46.019 --> 00:39:49.219
This compass, your wedding present,

00:39:49.219 --> 00:39:51.519
guided me to safe harbor.

00:39:51.519 --> 00:39:53.359
The least I can do is help you keep your farm.

00:39:54.659 --> 00:40:00.379
Ah.

00:40:00.379 --> 00:40:03.480
We will find a way to pay you back.

00:40:03.480 --> 00:40:06.159
I'm not worried about that, Mr. Kent.

00:40:06.159 --> 00:40:11.339
If it's not too presumptuous, I hope you just consider

00:40:11.339 --> 00:40:12.659
me part of the family.

00:40:24.659 --> 00:40:36.859
Hi, Lana.

00:40:41.339 --> 00:40:43.159
Glad your parents are getting a second chance.

00:40:45.219 --> 00:40:46.819
Yeah, I, uh...

00:40:46.819 --> 00:40:49.159
I think I'll be earning every cent of my allowance this year.

00:40:49.799 --> 00:40:50.359
So you're staying?

00:40:50.360 --> 00:40:56.240
I think I want to try to put all the stuff that happened in Metropolis behind me.

00:40:57.200 --> 00:40:59.539
Probably be a good idea if we put a lot of things behind us.

00:41:00.980 --> 00:41:01.940
I was just thinking that, too.

00:41:04.400 --> 00:41:08.720
Clark, I know there are things about you that you try to shield me from.

00:41:10.620 --> 00:41:12.460
But you don't have to protect me anymore.

00:41:16.980 --> 00:41:18.660
Whatever it is, I can handle it.

00:41:20.360 --> 00:41:22.599
I really want to know you.

00:41:27.599 --> 00:41:29.900
Look, uh...

00:41:29.900 --> 00:41:34.579
Lana, the way you looked at me in Metropolis, you were...

00:41:34.579 --> 00:41:35.500
You were disgusting.

00:41:35.900 --> 00:41:37.280
No, I was confused.

00:41:37.980 --> 00:41:39.320
You can't blame me for that.

00:41:39.320 --> 00:41:40.280
I don't blame you.

00:41:43.099 --> 00:41:45.500
I can't stand for you to ever look at me that way again.

00:41:46.300 --> 00:41:47.500
You weren't yourself.

00:41:50.360 --> 00:41:51.420
Yes, I was.

00:41:55.300 --> 00:41:57.320
Lana, I chose to let that part of me out.

00:41:57.980 --> 00:41:59.280
And it's always gonna be there.

00:42:01.120 --> 00:42:03.860
Trust me, you don't want to know me the way you think you do.

00:42:05.800 --> 00:42:07.960
Clark, that's my decision to make.

00:42:11.820 --> 00:42:12.780
Lana, I'm sorry.

00:42:12.780 --> 00:42:12.840
I'm sorry.

00:42:16.460 --> 00:42:17.820
I wanted this so much.

00:42:18.099 --> 00:42:20.340
And all last year, I tried so hard to be like you.

00:42:20.360 --> 00:42:21.360
I thought I'd be the right guy for you.

00:42:29.320 --> 00:42:30.120
But I'm not.

00:42:32.800 --> 00:42:33.880
This will never work.

00:42:42.480 --> 00:42:43.539
No, wait.

00:42:43.539 --> 00:42:46.740
I will go down with this.

00:42:48.039 --> 00:42:49.480
And I won't provide.

00:42:50.360 --> 00:42:51.360
I'm sorry.

00:42:53.360 --> 00:42:55.360
Clark, you never had to try.

00:43:20.360 --> 00:43:50.340
I'm sorry.

00:43:50.360 --> 00:44:20.340
I'm sorry.

